        "TileImage": "$($repository 93aeb20f-58d8-40c6-84e6-7211290f2088).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47.\r\rMy name is Kira, and I wish to offer you a contract. These five men are agents of L who are looking for me at this party. They&apos;ll never find me, however, if they&apos;re dead. I&apos;ll pay greatly if you do this in the outfit of the local biker gang. Try to be in and out in ten minutes.\r\rYours trurly,\rKira",
